 "id": 0}, {"id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "You should anticipate encountering difficult people and try to serve them as best you can. When dealing with challenging customers, you should remain professional and calm. You shouldn't cause a scene. When you interact with a difficult customer, you will require a certain amount of tact. For you to effectively serve an angry customer, you might want to be especially polite. If you are successful, you move beyond the emotional reaction to find the reason for their anger.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": ""}, {"text": "There are many reasons for customers to be dissatisfied or unhappy when you meet them. Perhaps they were improperly served by you or one of your co-workers in the past. Even if you were not personally involved in their previous experience, you represent the restaurant. If they aren't happy with the service, you are considered \u201cjust like that last server.\u201d This may seem unfair but you could make an attempt to make these customers happy.<br>\nCustomers can be rather demanding or domineering at times. Sometimes domineering behavior is a personality type, or it could be a temporary reaction to past customer service experiences. It can be challenging and frustrating to try to meet the needs of a demanding and indecisive customer.", "id": 2, "time": "26500", "image": ""}, {"text": "Some customers seem to go out of their way to be aggressive or to get attention. Outwardly, they seem confident and self-assured, but they may be insecure and defensive and this may be reflected in their behavior. Behavior they might exhibit includes: yelling, using profanity, demanding angrily to speak to a manager, being verbally abrupt (snapping at you) while you're trying to help them, ignoring what you say, or insulting you or the restaurant.", "id": 3, "time": "68000", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn11le05ob02re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 4, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": "I promise that by the time you can adequately serve six passengers at a time, you will serve in first class. If you spill a beverage on a passenger during turbulence, you will call me immediately. When you hear inappropriate comments from passengers, you will respond to them respectfully but firmly.", "type": "p"}], "_data": [], "type": "text", "template_override": 1}]}]}